<title>USA: U.S. weekly railcar loadings - April 12 week - AAR.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly railcar loadings - April 12 week - AAR.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Association of American Railroads reported weekly railcar loadings as follows:</p>
<p>    -		 Pct Change	 Week Ending:</p>
<p>    -		From Year Ago  04/12/97   04/13/96</p>
<p> Grain		   -18.9	 22,883     28,224</p>
<p> Grain Mill Products  -2.9	  9,200	9,471</p>
<p> Other Farm Products  -8.1	  1,048	1,140</p>
<p> Metallic Ores	   1.6	 19,352     19,050</p>
